  "riverSelectionMethod": "Editorial overview selection of nine named river features already in the pinned Natural Earth file. Not a ranking by river length, flow, basin area or importance. SourceName equality retains the published segments and does not add named tributaries.",
  "labelMethod": "From River features only: choose the longest existing separate line using cos(latitude)-weighted coordinate distance for locator placement, then select existing vertices nearest 50%, 25% and 75% of cumulative distance. No geometry or label point interpolation. This distance is not a published river-length measurement.",
  "relationMethod": "For every existing vertex of each selected named river feature, use even-odd point-in-polygon containment in all 1037 existing BasinATLAS display polygons, respecting holes. Choose the polygon containing the most tested vertices. Preserve every match, unmatched count and source identity. No buffers, geometry union, snapping or expansion.",
  "relationScope": "照合は河道頂点と収録集水区の位置関係です。原本の正式な川名対応ではなく、河道の長さに対する割合や全流域の完全性を示しません。Natural Earth 1:50,000,000 の一般化された線と、HydroBASINS の接続構造を基礎とする BasinATLAS レベル6統合区画（表示境界を0.008度で一般化）は尺度・処理が異なります。頂点間の全線分の包含も保証しません。境界や線の隙間を拡張・接続していません。",
